      "advertDescription": "This 2015 Nissan Juke DIG-T Tekna is a practical compact crossover that combines a 1.2 litre petrol engine with the high specification of the Tekna trim level. As a Euro 6 compliant vehicle, it meets modern emission standards while offering a balanced driving experience. The interior is well equipped with heated front seats for added comfort and an intelligent key system that allows for keyless entry and push button starting. Drivers can also benefit from seamless connectivity through the integrated Bluetooth telephone system and maintain a comfortable cabin environment using the automatic climate control, which includes a pollen filter.\n\nThe vehicle is designed to be both economical and easy to manage, making it a sensible choice for daily driving. It achieves an impressive fuel economy of 50 mpg and benefits from low CO2 emissions, which helps to keep running costs down. Safety and convenience are prioritised through the included safety pack, which features blind spot assistance and a 360 degree camera system to aid with parking. Furthermore, the vehicle falls into a low insurance group, offering additional financial benefits compared to many other cars in its class.",
